# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for local `wrangler dev`. In production this is set via
# `wrangler secret put ADMIN_INTERNAL_KEY`, never committed here or in wrangler.jsonc.
#
# Sent as the X-Identity-Credential header on every call to the cloudfare-identity
# Worker (alongside X-Identity-Application: Trainfree.Admin and the user's Access token
# in X-Identity-Token). It must equal the ADMIN_INTERNAL_KEY value held by
# cloudfare-identity. Not needed for everyday local dev, since wrangler.jsonc's
# LOCAL_DEV_BYPASS returns a synthetic identity without calling the IDENTITY binding;
# only required to exercise the real service-binding path (LOCAL_DEV_BYPASS unset).
ADMIN_INTERNAL_KEY=
